# Generate: for every plan on the sheet, in the order they were added, a DRAFT claim of the plan's amount, dated
# that day with an empty note, for each plan date (the start, then every N days) up to its end and the sheet's today
# that it has made none for yet, by the claim form's rules: a date the form refuses is skipped (and tried again next
# time). A plan naming a descendant sheet makes its claims there, for the person of the same name
# (none when there is none), by that sheet's rules and in its audit. Answers how many claims were made. A viewer's generate that would make a claim is refused (400) before it
# makes any; with nothing to make it makes none, which changes nothing, so it answers 0.
